# ---- why a NEW call is added for the same class: the trigger found in the logs ----
#   For a call outside the class plan (task T): compare interactions that ran T with interactions that did not.
#   (1) earlier result: a field=value seen in an output BEFORE T's first call, vs anywhere in interactions without T
#   (2) input: a word of the first message
