       f"- Interactions that do not fit their class: {len(MISFIT)} (validation workbook, Misfits and Misfit_Patterns).",
       "- Trigger rule: present in more than half of the interactions with the new call and in less than half without it (same rule as the hand-off test), "
       "Fisher's exact test + BH; values that only repeat the call's own request are ignored.",
       f"- Calls outside the plan: {found} of {len(TRIG)} tested have a proven trigger (Branch_Triggers); the rest are listed in Unexplained_Calls."]
md += ["", "## 8. Honest check: does the input predict the class?", ""]
if IN_SUM:
    md += [f"- From the first message alone, on unseen interactions: accuracy {IN_SUM['acc']:.1%} vs {IN_SUM['base']:.1%} by always guessing the biggest class; "
           f"macro F1 {IN_SUM['macro_f1']:.3f} ({IN_SUM['tested']:,} interactions, {IN_SUM['classes']} classes with >= {args.folds} interactions)."]
    md += [f"- Input -> {r['Hand-off call']}: AUC {r['AUC on unseen (0.5 = chance, 1 = perfect)']:.3f} ({r['Reading']}); words: {r['Words in the input that point to this expert']}" for r in IN_HO]
    weak = class_check[class_check["Flags"].str.contains("Input does not")]
    md += [f"- Classes the input does not separate: {len(weak)} ({', '.join(weak['Class'].head(10))}{' …' if len(weak) > 10 else ''})."]
else:
    md += ["- Not tested: not enough interactions with a logged first message."]
md += ["", "## 9. Files", "",
       f"- `{BOOK.name}` - the decomposition: Interactions (with input), Classes, Class_Variants, Task_Plan (with conditional steps), API_Catalog (hover a header for its meaning).",
       f"- `{VBOOK.name}` - validation: accuracy, accuracy by class, folds, hand-off test, DAG edges, data preparation, approved traces, branch triggers, unexplained calls, misfits, class check, input checks, API count matrix.",
       "- `run.log` - the full log of this run."]
(OUT / "report.md").write_text("\n".join(md), encoding="utf-8")
log.info(f"   report -> {OUT / 'report.md'}")
log.info(f"Finished in {TOTAL:.0f}s")
